<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID V WIDZEW LODZ TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID V WIDZEW LODZ TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup</p>
<p>Champions League, group B match between Atletico Madrid of Spain</p>
<p>and Widzew Lodz of Poland:</p>
<p>Atletico Madrid - 1-Jose Molina, 2-Pablo, 20-Delfin Geli, 6-</p>
<p>Santi,</p>
<p>3-Toni, 21-Jose-Luis Caminero, 8-Juan Vizcaino, 14-Diego</p>
<p>Simeone,</p>
<p>10-Milinko Pantic, 9-Juan Esnaider, 19-Kiko.</p>
<p>Widzew Lodz - 1-Maciej Szczeny, 2-Miroslaw Szymkowiak,</p>
<p>3-Tomasz Lapinski, 5-Pavel Wojtala, 6-Marek Citko, 7-Radoslaw</p>
<p>Michalski, 10-Ryszard Czerwiec, 17-Andrzej Michalczuk, 15-Daniel</p>
<p>Bogusz, 12-Slawomir Majak,</p>
<p>8-Jacek Dembinski.</p>
</text>
